2	 * Recover a server stuck in ERROR after a failed reinstall clone (its VM was
3	 * destroyed but the re-clone failed). Flips ONLY an ERROR server back to STOPPED
4	 * so the tested reinstall flow in the portal can rebuild it. Does nothing to a
5	 * server in any other state.
6	 *
7	 *   node scripts/recover-errored-server.mjs <hostname|serverId>
8	 *
9	 * After this, grant the missing Proxmox privilege (SDN.Use) and re-run the
10	 * reinstall from the portal — the clone will succeed and the VM is rebuilt.
